Well Elisa, no shame in asking.  I am also new to this group and don't
know if it has been addressed, so I will answer for you.  No
guarantees anyone else will...

The marker can be used to write on blank scrolls.  You can take a
blank scroll and turn it into a scroll of genocide or enchant armor.
Provided that you have already discovered either of those types of
scrolls that game.  You cannot write a scroll that you don't know
exists.  Apply it to the blank scroll and it will ask what you want to
write.  One more hint:  you can create blank scrolls by dipping them
into fountains (the scroll that is...).  Or potions of holy water to
bless it.

